  "$description": "Vectors of the evaluator of the steps of the guide (docs/adr/0084, `guide.states`), pinned by the web (tests/test_guide_states.py) and by the mobile app, as it pins the recurrence vectors. A case is a sequence of snapshots of the rows of the example home, each with the steps ticked after it: a tick is stored as soon as its state is true and it stays, so `ticked` only grows. A row is `{entity, fields}`; a field is named as in the `where` of `guide.json` (a foreign key without `_id`), a decimal is a string. The rows are those of the example home only. Only steps that have a state appear; the four steps ticked by hand never do.",
